@startuml
title State Diagram - Online Quiz System

[*] --> Registered : User registration/login


state Registered
state TeacherMode
state StudentMode
state DraftQuizState
state PostedQuizState
state ViewingResultsState


Registered --> TeacherMode : Select teacher mode
Registered --> StudentMode : Select student mode


TeacherMode --> DraftQuizState : Create new quiz
DraftQuizState --> DraftQuizState : Edit existing quiz
DraftQuizState --> PostedQuizState : Save as draft or post for students
PostedQuizState --> ViewingResultsState : Quiz over, view results


StudentMode --> ViewingResultsState : Student selects a quiz and submits it
ViewingResultsState --> Registered : View result after submitting the quiz


TeacherMode --> DraftQuizState : Edit existing quiz
DraftQuizState --> DraftQuizState : Save as draft or post for students

@enduml
